  douyin2text/_vendor/tokens.py
      A subset of src/dtk/signing/native/tokens.py containing only the pure,
      IO-free token generators. The upstream module also mints cookies over
      HTTP; that half was dropped and cookie minting is done by driving a real
      browser instead (see douyin2text/session.py).

  douyin2text/douyin.py
  douyin2text/session.py
      The Douyin request parameter table, the two signature construction paths
      and the salted x-secsdk-web-signature algorithm are ported from
      src/dtk/platforms/douyin/{params,endpoints}.py and
      src/dtk/signing/native/{signer,websign}.py. The code around them - the
      CLI, the HTTP service, the pipeline and the caching - is original to this
      repository.

Changes made to the derived files: the package-relative import of sm3 was
rewritten, dead branches and browser-only paths were removed, and comments were
rewritten. No signatures or parameter values were altered.
